WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
Time to draw your conclusions.

2
00:00:02.225 --> 00:00:04.480
Choose one other suspect on your phone,

3
00:00:04.785 --> 00:00:06.720
check the portrait and public seal,

4
00:00:07.025 --> 00:00:09.200
then confirm your accusation.

5
00:00:09.665 --> 00:00:12.160
Once it's sealed, it stays sealed.

6
00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.220
The big screen will show the truth

7
00:00:14.225 --> 00:00:15.920
when your game master calls it.
